      "text": "I polished you a safe spot.",
      "voice_id": "Rc2mSW0SK2gMydCaY9rQ",
      "file": "vo_sesame_lobby_3.mp3",
      "bytes": 27210,
      "sha256": "b2adbf7f7f7da5fb9a88e6257798e91066df4f59bca97c3d3de680f599582e61",
      "duration_ms": 1624,
      "peakDbtp": -5.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 13.7,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b02_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "You call it waste. I can still hear their names.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b02_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "sha256": "ccf4d5a1a318011450b979378d2d61b6db65b1d10be20073b1c0e3ca9ce85931",
      "duration_ms": 3117,
      "peakDbtp": -3.9,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 1.54,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b02_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "I will not let another memory wash away!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b02_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 38913,
      "sha256": "ce6c9ac5a544a3a605ddddb18cc9c0fff7943e8f1c26e59b9dc2f5aeca95c9cf",
      "duration_ms": 2370,
      "peakDbtp": -9.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.9,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b02_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "The pipes are full. There is nowhere left to keep them!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b02_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 59393,
      "sha256": "df2a3d9688d6dd278a2d81003e92116d0234a860a4858060e2daa9ebd933ec16",
      "duration_ms": 3651,
      "peakDbtp": -7.6,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 9.16,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b02_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "The water is clear… I can hear each voice again.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b02_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 60229,
      "sha256": "a80a8e4608e77f6a79cddd9be1eab7dd5381efbf94d354681379842bee60bb8f",
      "duration_ms": 3696,
      "peakDbtp": -2.7,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.28,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b03_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "The stove must stay lit. Someone is still waiting for dinner.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b03_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 53959,
      "sha256": "d9538023d36f084c80c876835747860d94714dd5a14bf675254ea13047ea12c0",
      "duration_ms": 3300,
      "peakDbtp": -2.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.35,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b03_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Just one more tray. Then everyone can eat.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b03_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 38913,
      "sha256": "03f210072354b14e392c4e074355f8194d03aef4713f78e8d8f8bd63c0488c95",
      "duration_ms": 2355,
      "peakDbtp": -2.8,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 14.6,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b03_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Why does every meal smell like smoke?",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b03_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 28882,
      "sha256": "7d482c50a01a2f1c5476fe6684777f8af27cbfb189b877078a812903ba7ad076",
      "duration_ms": 1749,
      "peakDbtp": -2.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 3.7,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b03_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "At last… I can let the stove cool.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b03_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 58975,
      "sha256": "2c1616afba2a53ae6b890c7d0e6da49ec1623dbfd71cb10b7d5a6ec2342cc1d2",
      "duration_ms": 3606,
      "peakDbtp": -2.3,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.67,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b04_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "If the ice melts, what will protect them from forgetting?",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b04_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "sha256": "0ff16bdd4c26d36431fd48e4c1b417ada359378bd88d5b7352dc54dca3cd2ce0",
      "duration_ms": 2658,
      "peakDbtp": -4.2,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.44,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b04_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Stay frozen. Stay safe. That was the order.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b04_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 43928,
      "sha256": "823d334eeff831c09e307f6ee86d86822660b491c6cc98b9026860e5e722002e",
      "duration_ms": 2686,
      "peakDbtp": -8.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.01,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b04_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Do not take the last shelter I can give them!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b04_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "sha256": "8ea5ef742449065461c2cb7ee9980f9ce6f2164d2b1fc3a1312db704f39019d2",
      "duration_ms": 2477,
      "peakDbtp": -7.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.19,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b04_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Their voices… they are warmer than I remember.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b04_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 47690,
      "sha256": "e5c790df6538ee675e4a1c55fa3ec4473edfd9b8aed161d74d51bf171f68fecd",
      "duration_ms": 2902,
      "peakDbtp": -2.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.85,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b06_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Mother said I would bloom forever if I brought enough flavor.",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b06_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 56467,
      "sha256": "58395e365444580db0e398aaa0f06b4745b1cb0cbc9544c25b95f6f81da1e56e",
      "duration_ms": 3464,
      "peakDbtp": -4.3,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.03,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b06_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Do not let my petals fall before she sees me!",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b06_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 34733,
      "sha256": "420b4b6023a989f0f7d8f736ee312a644c966f0f9ee4a42968e3054008c4fd7e",
      "duration_ms": 2100,
      "peakDbtp": -6.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 3.81,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b06_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Every spore carries a memory. I need them all!",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b06_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "sha256": "c39de7ddc877d210041c112e8fd2b0766d2349a386da9c2164c4f72367243664",
      "duration_ms": 2541,
      "peakDbtp": -4.3,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.01,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b06_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Mother… was any of this garden ever mine?",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b06_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "sha256": "4c21947feddf2b0c82f44193ff83fd05b4ac97203e239c20e4986ff5ddd94300",
      "duration_ms": 2069,
      "peakDbtp": -3.3,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.26,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b08_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "My workers brought this home. It has to be enough.",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b08_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 50616,
      "sha256": "c5125ebbad4a4125fd6111cdd74fd250c715a661de804fa92382913d7014a4aa",
      "duration_ms": 3094,
      "peakDbtp": -4.9,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.64,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b08_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Every drop belongs in the royal stores!",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b08_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 37241,
      "sha256": "fe5467806011fc978337d5390ff23ddc1c64e5ad0ec0947ac673f47e27db2818",
      "duration_ms": 2260,
      "peakDbtp": -6.1,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.17,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b08_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Do not show my workers an empty flower!",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b08_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 33897,
      "sha256": "4bfdac3176d79056c83ac3db00bb1409c63d2925a3e00bae04a17351eaa8bdc6",
      "duration_ms": 2051,
      "peakDbtp": -6.1,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.99,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b08_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "The honey… we were feeding them the curse.",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b08_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 37241,
      "sha256": "a67070a767d3991064e9bcc5abc49648318b7770c1db8e4357598aff5ff5a451",
      "duration_ms": 2261,
      "peakDbtp": -6.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.81,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b10_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "I kept every voice alive. Why do they all ask to leave?",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b10_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 56467,
      "sha256": "a1a172d2d6fa76974887184ca6852ba7411a705aa3f4cbe484949bb10e11d53f",
      "duration_ms": 3467,
      "peakDbtp": -3.2,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 3.08,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b10_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "My roots have held this kingdom for centuries!",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b10_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "sha256": "2654dd3907746c27af0033f81ede2fb1a7cd43a704b9bff695ce43c50868252f",
      "duration_ms": 2066,
      "peakDbtp": -3.8,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 14.24,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b10_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "Do not ask a mother to loosen her hold!",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b10_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 35151,
      "sha256": "96762dc0369d78e37dc9eb55e27090a6f982ca38e78cc0c43cf650e02eb6becc",
      "duration_ms": 2123,
      "peakDbtp": -6.0,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 2.68,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b10_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c3",
      "text": "The one who planted me… he is still waiting.",
      "voice_id": "akO64UeBz1XW95nNmuVW",
      "file": "vo_b10_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 49362,
      "sha256": "ddb4294b9548147c6de2d91d33532f4988b19bbf0259e2009f63fd2bdefb52a0",
      "duration_ms": 3028,
      "peakDbtp": -5.1,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.58,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b11_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "There must be one more row. Someone is still hungry.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b11_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 67752,
      "sha256": "cf90efe25a9a99ec83f8c3517e81a7e79f6bd103e600e89376564db7d4ffea8e",
      "duration_ms": 4157,
      "peakDbtp": -8.8,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.26,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b11_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "The granaries cannot be empty. I harvested everything!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b11_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 52705,
      "sha256": "2daa596ba6c60da4b67da69cafca0536593a91b2cc8ed1da82d8a5cf5ba316d3",
      "duration_ms": 3217,
      "peakDbtp": -8.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.24,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b11_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Stand back. I have not finished the last row!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b11_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "sha256": "244ef2f3c108947477313698d19b1c81d244b9f728ceaf673f577e33c027b327",
      "duration_ms": 2647,
      "peakDbtp": -7.0,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 0.09,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b11_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "The fields were green once… plant something for them.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b11_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 63154,
      "sha256": "c2fa33e7598a308227539fd3c50737594deb1359452d24f432cb5f1fc0dfe3d0",
      "duration_ms": 3885,
      "peakDbtp": -2.6,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.35,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b13_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Outside, everything breaks. Here, I can still keep them whole.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b13_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 87396,
      "sha256": "c65b991ff508c27d04d30039d0e75348b65193edc4ac64d1a1f84679aa308df1",
      "duration_ms": 5387,
      "peakDbtp": -6.1,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 5.08,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b13_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "That reflection is the kingdom before we failed it!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b13_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 45600,
      "sha256": "e030688b64021a89b7524c2c67d014cc5c66f8367387db479593a4c6067a53ae",
      "duration_ms": 2772,
      "peakDbtp": -8.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.64,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b13_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "I will not let another future shatter!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b13_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 31390,
      "sha256": "ef987d184644a2d241f1c9c3561f9424a809c12e6c6942cafb7e9277fc980b57",
      "duration_ms": 1888,
      "peakDbtp": -7.8,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.94,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b13_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Let them grow in the sun… even if the glass cannot follow.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b13_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 79873,
      "sha256": "9f78ca0d53b40221279e3821c57d91ddf7dce9aa7ba897cb93e3ce30474bb1b2",
      "duration_ms": 4935,
      "peakDbtp": -2.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.76,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b14_intro",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "I know that seed. One has been missing all this time.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b14_intro.mp3",
      "bytes": 98263,
      "sha256": "ff20a4c5eed055e88c4d42832ba63ffd1cd1a3a8028e6c47aa6561339e9951dd",
      "duration_ms": 6084,
      "peakDbtp": -11.4,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.81,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b14_fight_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "A closed vault cannot make another mistake!",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b14_fight_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 36823,
      "sha256": "3a4379bff84dfa13dfbeb40ed3a08d32ef4dc833c774c0613919c17ed9d47b75",
      "duration_ms": 2246,
      "peakDbtp": -5.6,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 6.53,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b14_fight_2",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "If one seed changed everything, what might another do?",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b14_fight_2.mp3",
      "bytes": 41421,
      "sha256": "075fc536958a06ef69e8d73d749c7eb5ae70abdc7d8d1bff3552fd9a583839bb",
      "duration_ms": 2519,
      "peakDbtp": -7.2,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 4.67,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b14_release",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Then take them… plant them well. Do not keep them as I did.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b14_release.mp3",
      "bytes": 77783,
      "sha256": "0c1c065a4d90c1ea4928dbe9fb06b2fb133dfbec43fa9f4d898e660041b8655b",
      "duration_ms": 4807,
      "peakDbtp": -5.5,
      "leadingSilenceMs": 8.64,
      "sampleRate": 44100,
      "channels": 1,
      "loop": false
    },
    {
      "key": "vo_b02_slip_1",
      "speaker": "boss_c2",
      "text": "Those voices… I remember them.",
      "voice_id": "1fQG71AjI2V2lnywmnx0",
      "file": "vo_b02_slip_1.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "sha256": "80e03469b006624e3e08c352e8e6ed20f25fc4ee55d1361655f3e9457eb0b8d9",
      "duration_ms": 2736,
      "peakDbtp": -7.8,
